      "message": "I think it is entirely reasonable to expose this as a public API.  This is actually a gap for `TelecomManager#addNewIncomingCall` which is pre-existing.  An app can already set the phone number for an incoming call via `EXTRA_INCOMING_CALL_ADDRESS`. \n\nFor consistency, let\u0027s name this `EXTRA_INCOMING_CALL_PRESENTATION`.  Can you also please references this from the API docs for `TelecomManager#addNewIncomingCall` for consistency as well?",
